Z||000003||Monkeyman||04-22-2000||12:57 PM||||stimpy--I refuse to get involved with controversial subjects anymore.  I'd be willing to fight with you for a little while, but I'm just too darn tired right now! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Maybe later.<P>William Federle--I had the same problem with my name.  Someone suggested I try my name with a period after it.  Guess what?  It worked!  You might try that.  The Grape Ape isn't doing so well.  I believe I have a motor lined up but I need to save some $$ for the swap.  I just don't think I can do it myself.  Just not ready for something that big yet.  It'll cost something like $850 for the local shop to do the swap.  After that, I'll still need lots of cosmetics, but at least it'll be running.  I'm hoping to get it going by the middle of next month.  I had a deal going to get it done but it fell through.  No big deal.  It wasn't his fault, just one of those things.||||reg||1
